{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act51side_level_act51side_st02",
  "groupId": "act51side",
  "stageId": "act51side_st02",
  "title": "完整的缺损",
  "storyCode": "PA-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act51side/level_act51side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e78adc3d9de9cea99716cbbf8d9347e29e4287f9ee48cfc2ef0686c0cf8d4c94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "肃静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "诸位，所有证人均已陈述完毕，相信诸位大人已从各方证词中得到了线索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "鉴于“卡托加事件”牵涉甚广，且证词存在诸多矛盾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "仲裁委员会需要时间对所有证据进行“闭门核查”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "现在宣布听证会流程到此结束。两小时后，我们将正式公布“卡托加事件”的最终审议结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "（压低声音）是时候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "七嘴八舌的讨论又一次在她四周响起，几位贵族不出所料地与仲裁人同行，走向厅内的过道。\n苦艾摇了摇头，穿过熙熙攘攘的人群，走出门时，她回头对上书记官的目光。\n书记官面无表情，视线仿佛穿透了她，落在虚无的空气中。但他不动声色地竖起了手中的记录本——\n那上面一片雪白，空无一字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "呼......真是场漫长的闹剧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "难以置信，连特里波列夫家的小孩都会犯错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦虑的贵族",
      "text": "不过，重点还是在索尼娅身上，仲裁人阁下，您打算怎么定性？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "这取决于我们需要她成为什么样的“反面教材”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦虑的贵族",
      "text": "我们需要她是一个疯子，阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦虑的贵族",
      "text": "有的新贵族试图利用皇帝陛下狡辩，连“勤王护驾有功”这种鬼话都讲得出口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦虑的贵族",
      "text": "必须得放大索尼娅的危害性，不趁这个机会收拾那些暴发户，将来他们会变本加厉地颠倒黑白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "......等特里波列夫公爵到了再一起决定，他还需要一些时间平复心情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "等等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "这是什么声音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "仲裁人阁下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "发生什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "有消息说，有一群歹徒突袭了三号监狱，劫走了许多犯人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "因为这个事情，刚才大家都吵翻了，需要您来主持秩序。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "三号监狱这么随便就被突破了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "我们的警力都集中在这附近，余下的人不够提前发现那些歹徒，才导致了这一失误。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "......不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "外面的学生呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "他们刚刚都解散回家了，您的意思是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仲裁人",
      "text": "我的意思是，你们这些废物！赶紧找出带头的，把他抓回来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌萨斯警察",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "积极的学生",
      "text": "喂，醒醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "......你是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "积极的学生",
      "text": "你就是拉列亚吧，这座监狱已经被我们攻占了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "积极的学生",
      "text": "趁他们的援军还没赶到，赶紧离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "我没有弄错吧......你们是来救我的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "积极的学生",
      "text": "当然不止是你，你先出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "惊喜与困意交织，拉列亚顶着发懵的脑袋，一步步地跨过倒在地上的狱警。\n他的思绪飘荡，原来自己的威望已然如此......他要回到学生联合大会，成为不亚于奥尔佳的领袖角色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "同学们......我的同胞们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "看着你们，我就知道，自由的火种从未熄灭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "积极的学生",
      "text": "二队！二队把缺口守住！这边的牢房都打开了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "咳咳——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "正如你们所见，虽然这漆黑的牢笼禁锢了我的肉体，但它无法禁锢我的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的学生",
      "text": "借过！别挡道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "......没关系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉列亚",
      "text": "我知道，你们是为了我而来的。为了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没有一个人回应他......他看着面前眼熟的各个身影，却发觉这群昔日的同学不知何时已经变得陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊啊，累死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我刚从那鬼地方跑出来，又要和你们干这一票。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "别抱怨了，卓娅都没说什么呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "索尼娅，你的想法一直都这么大胆吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没想到我们居然真的能在那些人的眼皮子底下玩出这套......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "卓娅，先前你主动提出要出席听证会拖延时间，我们还担心了好久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "本来娜塔莉娅都找人安排好了，不用让你去冒这么大风险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "古米本来也不用全程参与行动的，可她还是来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哼，说到这个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凛冬姐——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我已经道过歉啦！而且，我不也没怎么受伤吗？真理姐还说我有帮上忙，你不能再骂我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "谁说我要骂你了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "如果不是你和坚雷教官，还有......弑君者，之前闯出封锁区的时候，我们还得分出精力提防来自动力层的袭击。你们确实帮上了忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "冬将军承认了呀。就像如果不是卓娅主动去听证会把这场戏演足，或许今天也不会有这么顺利的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我们不会把任何人排除在外了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "我没有想把她们排除在外......算了，事实证明这确实是我计划上的疏漏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "不过我更没想到，再见到你们的时候，外面原本各行其是的学生，已经变成了一支紧密的队伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "也辛苦你了，真理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "还不是因为你太莽撞了，我只能这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "好啦，索尼娅，安娜，我们都该想想下一步的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，对。我们出发之前，坚雷教官说罗德岛准备好了安全屋，让我们结束后不要回办事处，直接过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "说是要先......“避避风头”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "之后在圣骏堡，我们只能隐秘行动了。所幸学校那边我已经安排好了，接收情报还是没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "那就走啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "哦，等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "卓娅，你是不是忘了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看着凛冬疑惑的目光，她意识到了什么，从包里拿出了一个铁徽章——握紧的拳头的图案，还是崭新的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "嗯，你带着呢。之后要好好戴在身上啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "你以前就该是我们的一员，现在和以后，更加得是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "凛冬，你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嘿嘿卓娅，以后可有你受的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "冬将军看起来嘻嘻哈哈，以前自己也不乐意戴这东西。但现在你要是被她逮到几次忘戴徽章，她那个脸色可——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "......别说了，不是还要避风头吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "这地方七弯八拐的，真不好找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "大概是为了保证安全性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "是啊。之前你们在其他城市里活动的时候，卓娅和我每周都要换一个像这样的新据点，才好继续接收情报，准备下一步的行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "反正我是干不了这种活的，换成其他时候，让我在这待两天就得无聊死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "其实也没那么枯燥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "是罗莎琳自己坐不住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "欸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "你们来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "啊。难道这里其实是你的安全屋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "就当作是罗德岛的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "索尼娅，她是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "弑君者，柳德米拉。她和我们一样，也是圣骏堡办事处的派驻干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "（点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "她们看上去都不认识你。看来就算我专门找你说了，你也还是没往心里去啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "罗德岛在乌萨斯的资源尚且有限，最好先留给更需要的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "而且，我找过办事处，古米帮了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我觉得那算是互相帮助！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "text": "好吧。有个开头总比没有好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "总之，你们可以在这里待一段时间，等风头过去，坚雷会来通知你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯？那你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我要离开圣骏堡一段时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "正在追踪的任务有了重要进展，我现在必须先尽快去那边核实情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......古米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "为什么要跟着我？快回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "你要去爸爸在通讯里提到的那个地方，对不对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "这是我的任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可那里有古米的爸爸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我甚至还没有确定他说的具体是哪个卫星城，跟着我，不一定能见到你父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "这与任务危险与否无关，只是现在你没有必要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "柳德米拉姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "如果你找到了那个卫星城，见到了我爸爸，或者我妈妈，你会告诉我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好。那我还有最后一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "早露姐刚才说，你以前是整合运动的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "她说的是真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可是凛冬姐说这不重要，烈夏姐说她本来也不打算和你有什么接触。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "真理姐和苦艾姐都沉默了，古米心里也有自己的看法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "那时候，你不在那里，对不对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "你不在彼得海姆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红发的青年女性沉默了。黑暗中，她握紧了双拳，而后又伸展开去。\n她望着女孩恳切的双眼，最终缓缓、缓缓地摇了摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "可我在切尔诺伯格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "我曾经是那个整合运动的一员，无论它产生的邪恶是否曾真的经过我的双手，我都需要与它共同承担罪责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "逃避毫无用处。因此，我不奢求原谅或是和解。只是现在，这一次，至少这一次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "如果我还有挽回些什么的机会，那我一定要去做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "古米睁大了眼睛，似乎在思考着弑君者的发言。很快，她又微笑起来，从口袋里掏出一颗蜂蜜糖。\n隔着手套，她把糖塞进弑君者的掌心里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......这是什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "这是约定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我明白凛冬姐为什么说不重要了。我们已经长大，长大到即使选择不去迁怒和怨恨，也能获得内心的平静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我会等你回来，等你带着爸爸的消息，或者妈妈的消息——甚至是他们两个人的消息，回来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我想相信。我想相信可靠的柳德米拉姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "第二天，我回到了那条街道，一个人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的工人",
      "text": "喂喂，注意一下，这可是议员派的活儿，要是磕坏了东西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的工人",
      "text": "但是你看到了吗？那个混蛋巴普洛维奇，就是在那片封锁区里被砸成了馅饼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的工人",
      "text": "说不定之前，我们人人都踩了一脚他的尸体呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的工人",
      "text": "小点声！这里可不都是我们的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的工人",
      "text": "嗐，怎么可能有别人嘛，我们都在——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "兴奋的工人",
      "text": "您，您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "我是来找人的，不打扰你们工作。如果你担心我会出卖你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "巴普洛维奇死有余辜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安托沙向对方微微鞠躬，他穿过工人们的队伍，走到街道的对面，走向记忆中的门楣。\n被学校开除的时候，马特维将身无分文的他带回了家里，那是他自从来到圣骏堡后，第一次有了和家人吃饭的感觉。\n他还记得马特维的母亲，总是安静地微笑，搅动着红菜汤里为数不多的肉块，偷偷盛进他的碗中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他抬起头，是熟悉的甜菜与洋葱的味道。\n窗帘没有拉严，昏黄的灯光透了出来，他不禁朝着屋里看去。\n一位年迈的女士，从狭窄的厨房里捧出了一个陶罐，舀出红菜汤，分到了三个不同的碗里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "三份......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "那是留给我的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "你在信里到底写了什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯？外面有人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "听到屋里的声音，他像是最卑劣的窃贼，拿出为马特维所写的讣告，夹在了窗户的边缘，转身逃开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "（压低声音）该死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "（压低声音）什么时候变得这么软弱了，安托沙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休息的工人",
      "text": "年轻人，别跑那么急，让一让。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休息的工人",
      "text": "驮兽有点累了，搬点旧家具也不容易，嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安托沙点点头，他侧过了身子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "马特维？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "驮车上的镜子，映着灰暗的街道、狼狈的自己、属于过去的身影。\n阳光铺满了马特维的脸庞。他是那么地真实、鲜活，没有不甘的表情和被灰尘沾染的伤口，只是胸膛上插着一束樱桃花......\n鲜血的颜色，从花蕊到花瓣，渐渐晕散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "是你吗，朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "我明明看见你，看见利斯特、尤拉......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "我记得每个人的死亡，记得你们每一句祈祷与告别，还有那些没能留下遗言的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "你会告诉我，这一切都是虚假的，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "......不，安托沙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "你有没有想象过，我本该会过上的人生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "我还会留在校园里，遇上更多值得交往的朋友，在春天的河流边写下今年的第一首诗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "下午没课的时候，我会回到家里，等着母亲炖好汤，我会念起写给她的文章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "她肯定听不懂，但是会眯起眼睛，笑着和我说：“多吃点，我亲爱的大学生。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "马特维，马特维，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "为什么是，我活着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "因为，你还有机会，过上我想过的人生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“马特维”",
      "text": "放下吧安托沙，我知道，你到底背负着担子走了多少年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "过上那样美好的人生......我真的可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "......每一个乌萨斯人都可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马特维，如果我没有选择反抗这片充满压迫的大地，\n我还会和你成为朋友吗......\n过去的身影没有回答，只是轻轻发出一声叹息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "离开故乡后，安托沙第二次流下了眼泪。\n他活着，但他的一部分灵魂，永远留在了卡托加区的废墟下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "活下去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "如果现在放弃了，马特维就永远是帝国贵族口中的叛徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "会有那么一天，我会把他和老师，把无缚者同盟的大家，都刻在属于烈士的石碑上......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "text": "再给我一些时间吧，我的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他用满是尘土与污垢的袖子，抹过了自己的眼睛。\n随后他抬起步子，跟在了工人队伍的最后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在这工人队伍的另一头，一个年轻人望着这座陌生的城市，甚至没发觉自己扛在肩上的箱子已滑落于地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的工人",
      "text": "喂，兄弟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的工人",
      "text": "看什么呢这么认真？也让我们看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "text": "我好像......不，没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的工人",
      "text": "你来我们这里也几天了，别那么拘谨嘛，开心点，我们都进圣骏堡啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "text": "圣骏堡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼克托",
      "text": "你说得没错，到圣骏堡的这一路，可真是难熬......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天光逐渐消散，像是拉上了帷幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的军官",
      "text": "元帅把我们召集到这里，又是要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的军官",
      "text": "难道因为那小子遇刺，砍了他所有亲卫的脑袋都不够，还要追责到我们头上来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的军官",
      "text": "也可能是你想多了，只是又有预料外的紧急情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的军官",
      "text": "毕竟，即使半个月前军中爆发了小规模叛乱，从整体战况来看，第四集团军仍然与第二集团军相持不下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的军官",
      "text": "你的意思是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的军官",
      "text": "只是猜测，但或许，我们也没法再独善其身了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的军官",
      "text": "可第一集团军向来都是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "向来都是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的军官",
      "text": "......向来都是独、独立于派系之外的编制。我们不主动参与任何斗争，只维护乌萨斯的利益。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "既然是这样，各位又在忧心什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的军官",
      "text": "请恕我直言，总司令。您突然将我们从各自的驻地召集至此，一定有足够重要的缘由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的军官",
      "text": "那么这个缘由是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "我们的新型武器已经通过了理论测算阶段，可以投放试验。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威严的军人",
      "text": "我需要各军团配合，“悄无声息”地完成这场试爆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
